          "anchor": "cs329z-u02-c12-retrieval-diagnosis-p02",
          "answer": "100 failures: gold absent from corpus in 20 (coverage), present but unretrieved in 50 (ranking), retrieved but misread in the rest (generation). Check membership, then rank, then reader use.",
